1. Definitions
--------------

(a) "Dataset" means the DEBATE data made available in this repository,
    including all files, annotations, and associated metadata.

(b) "You" (or "User") means the individual or legal entity exercising
    permissions under this License.

(c) "Research Use" means use whose primary purpose is to advance or
    evaluate scientific, technical, or methodological knowledge, including
    training, testing, and analyzing models, and publishing research
    results.

(d) "Industry Research" means Research Use carried out by or within a
    for-profit company or other commercial organization, provided it
    complies with all restrictions in this License.

(e) "Commercial Use" means use of the Dataset or any derivative work
    that is primarily intended for commercial advantage, revenue
    generation, or integration into a paid or revenue-generating product
    or service.

(f) "Derivative Works" means any data, models, code, or other outputs
    that are created using the Dataset, including but not limited to
    trained or fine-tuned models, distilled datasets, embeddings, or
    synthetic data.

